perf: fix memory bloat and IPC over-serialization with large tool responses

- Strip redundant base64 image data from tool response before ToolBlock
  storage (ImageBlock already holds the data independently)
- Exclude messages/messageBlocks from IPC state sync to main process
  (these slices are never read by main process and were causing
  200-500ms serialization blocking every 100ms)

Measured: JS heap reduced from 1,077 MB to 341 MB (-68%), UI freezes
eliminated. See upstream PR CherryHQ/cherry-studio#12766.
